# Cornell Box — canonical GI ground-truth. Closed box, open at +Z (camera side).
# Units: metres. Interior spans X[-1,1] Y[0,2] Z[-1,1]. Walls are THIN SOLID SLABS (0.1m), not
# single quads: a flat one-sided quad bakes to a DEGENERATE SDF (ray-stab parity has no inside),
# which gave a ~50%-noisy hit fraction (speckle); a solid slab has a clean inside/outside SDF.
# Each slab is a closed box written outward from the interior face. Lit ONLY by the ceiling
# emissive quad -> surfaces off the light's direct cone are lit purely by INDIRECT bounce.
mtllib CornellBox.mtl
# t = slab thickness
# Helper note: each slab is 8 verts, 12 tris (6 quads), outward windings.

# ---- Floor (white): interior face at y=0, slab down to y=-0.1 ----
v -1 -0.1 -1
v  1 -0.1 -1
v  1 -0.1  1
v -1 -0.1  1
v -1  0.0 -1
v  1  0.0 -1
v  1  0.0  1
v -1  0.0  1
usemtl white
f -4 -3 -2 -1
f -5 -6 -7 -8
f -8 -7 -3 -4
f -6 -5 -1 -2
f -7 -6 -2 -3
f -5 -8 -4 -1

# ---- Ceiling (white): interior face at y=2, slab up to y=2.1 ----
v -1 2.0 -1
v  1 2.0 -1
v  1 2.0  1
v -1 2.0  1
v -1 2.1 -1
v  1 2.1 -1
v  1 2.1  1
v -1 2.1  1
usemtl white
f -4 -3 -2 -1
f -5 -6 -7 -8
f -8 -7 -3 -4
f -6 -5 -1 -2
f -7 -6 -2 -3
f -5 -8 -4 -1

# ---- Back wall (white): interior face at z=-1, slab back to z=-1.1 ----
v -1 0 -1.1
v  1 0 -1.1
v  1 2 -1.1
v -1 2 -1.1
v -1 0 -1.0
v  1 0 -1.0
v  1 2 -1.0
v -1 2 -1.0
usemtl white
f -4 -3 -2 -1
f -5 -6 -7 -8
f -8 -7 -3 -4
f -6 -5 -1 -2
f -7 -6 -2 -3
f -5 -8 -4 -1

# ---- Left wall (RED): interior face at x=-1, slab out to x=-1.1 ----
v -1.1 0 -1
v -1.1 0  1
v -1.1 2  1
v -1.1 2 -1
v -1.0 0 -1
v -1.0 0  1
v -1.0 2  1
v -1.0 2 -1
usemtl red
f -4 -3 -2 -1
f -5 -6 -7 -8
f -8 -7 -3 -4
f -6 -5 -1 -2
f -7 -6 -2 -3
f -5 -8 -4 -1

# ---- Right wall (GREEN): interior face at x=1, slab out to x=1.1 ----
v 1.0 0 -1
v 1.0 0  1
v 1.0 2  1
v 1.0 2 -1
v 1.1 0 -1
v 1.1 0  1
v 1.1 2  1
v 1.1 2 -1
usemtl green
f -4 -3 -2 -1
f -5 -6 -7 -8
f -8 -7 -3 -4
f -6 -5 -1 -2
f -7 -6 -2 -3
f -5 -8 -4 -1

# ---- Short box (white, right-front), solid cube ----
v  0.20 0.0 -0.10
v  0.75 0.0  0.10
v  0.55 0.0  0.65
v  0.00 0.0  0.45
v  0.20 0.6 -0.10
v  0.75 0.6  0.10
v  0.55 0.6  0.65
v  0.00 0.6  0.45
usemtl white
f -4 -3 -2 -1
f -8 -7 -6 -5
f -5 -1 -2 -6
f -8 -4 -1 -5
f -7 -3 -4 -8
f -6 -2 -3 -7

# ---- Tall box (white, left-back), solid cube ----
v -0.65 0.0 -0.60
v -0.10 0.0 -0.45
v -0.30 0.0  0.10
v -0.85 0.0 -0.05
v -0.65 1.2 -0.60
v -0.10 1.2 -0.45
v -0.30 1.2  0.10
v -0.85 1.2 -0.05
usemtl white
f -4 -3 -2 -1
f -8 -7 -6 -5
f -5 -1 -2 -6
f -8 -4 -1 -5
f -7 -3 -4 -8
f -6 -2 -3 -7

# ---- Ceiling area light (emissive quad, normal -Y) ----
v -0.35 1.979 -0.35
v  0.35 1.979 -0.35
v  0.35 1.979  0.35
v -0.35 1.979  0.35
usemtl light
f -4 -3 -2 -1
